	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scribam, reverende in Christo pater, amplius <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ad d. d. <persName ref="p18226">Pergulam</persName> eumque cohortabor, ut <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sedulo in id, quod petimus, incumbat, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et quantum video, non deerit officio suo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Te observat, me vero amat, et <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>cum superiori anno cum d. d. <persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>illas partes peragrarem inque morbum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>incidissem, omni officiorum genere <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>me prosequutus est.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Itaque nihil <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>est, quod mihi de eo non pollicear.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Caeteri, ut dicis, omnes foede cessant, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>multa quidem pollicentur, sed nihil <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>praestant.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scripsit tamen <persName ref="p2019">Augustinus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Maynardus</persName> comitem <persName ref="p2054">Ulissem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Martinengum</persName> proprium nuncium misisse <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l1107">Tridentum</placeName>, sed praeter orationes <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nihil conquirere potuisse; sed <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ne illas orationes quidem misit, i<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ta ut, quantum in illis est, iis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quoque ipsis careremus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quid <persName ref="p6831">Traversius</persName>, quid <persName>Fridericus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>post tot magnificas pollicitationes?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Verborum abunde sunt prodigi, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>cętera parcissimi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quomodo vero <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>facit ad stomachum tuum bella illa <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>oratio nomine <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ad patres habita?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nostri non scribent, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ut boni viri censebant, sed mittent <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>denuo legatos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Cum autem consul rem <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>in senatu <placeName ref="l893">Trium Foederum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>proponeret, mirum est, quanta animo<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>rum contentione res peracta sit; fueru<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>nt, qui nec scribendum nec legatos <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>mittendos censerent, propterea quod <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>consul <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinus</placeName> novissime consulem <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>nostrum ab omni actione superbe a<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>dmodum exclusisset<note type="misc">er hat in vor der thüren lassen staan und gesprochen, er möge wol heim; die sach sye uff guͦten wägen; man dörffe deren von Pündten und anderen Zuͦgewanten nüt</note></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ita con<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>sul mihi ipsi <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>et aliis <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>multis conques<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>tus es<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>t.<note type="margin">a.R.</note></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Consul <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>(ut est callidus) cum videret animos <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>exasperatos, mitigare cepit et consulem <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>modeste excusare, dicere illum sperasse <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>meliora et esse ipsum delusum et alia etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z24"/>Sic tandem obtentum, ut mitterentur <pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>legati.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Als aber diß das meer worden, <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>sind ouch die anderen zuͦgefallen, so darwider g<lb xml:id="p3z3"/>esyn, und gesprochen: wölle man botten <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>schicken, so sölle man ein anderen ernst <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>bruchen dan bißhar und sich nit von <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>einer einzigen person lassen by der nasen <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>umfüren etc.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Haec tibi; sed si mittitur <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>consul noster (ut legatio ei decreta <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>est), effice, ne ab actione excludatur; <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>quodsi enim in posterum fieret, vestris <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>apud nostros magnam invidiam conciliaret; <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>boni offenderentur, mali <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>confirmarentur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Intelligis ipse satis, <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>quae scribo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Dominum <persName ref="p6796">Thumisium</persName> nostri <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>amant et honorifice de eo loquuntur, <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>dicunt virum humanum et in congressibus <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>familiarem.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Itaque, si ille mittitur, <lb xml:id="p3z18"/>secreto commonendus erat, in id i<lb xml:id="p3z19"/>ncumberet, ne nostri negligerentur.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z20"/>Novi praeterea nihil habeo plane; <lb xml:id="p3z21"/>itaque excusatum me tibi puto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p3z22"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater, quam diutissi<lb xml:id="p3z23"/>me et felicissime.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> calendis decembris <lb xml:id="p3z24"/>anno 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z25"/>Remitto tua.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tu, <lb xml:id="p3z26"/>quaeso, si quid interea certi, ne celes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p8009">F[abricius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Non est opus, ut quicquam remittas; habebat <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>et hanc concionem <persName>Fontidonii</persName> ante; <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>si quid est reliqui, in alios distribue.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z4"/>Interim contuli manuscripta cum meis, quae misit <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>d. d. <persName ref="p18226">Pergula</persName>; mea continent plura folia; <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>priora congruunt cum iis, quae remisisti; sed <lb xml:id="p4z7"/>in meo scripto est amplius praeterea decretum <lb xml:id="p4z8"/>de reformatione; sunt additi canones undecim, <lb xml:id="p4z9"/>item decretum super concessione calicis, ubi reiicitur negocium ad po<lb xml:id="p4z10"/>ntificem.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Si haec habuisti, bene; sin minus, mittentur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, s<lb xml:id="p4z11"/>uo in Christo domino et pat<lb xml:id="p4z12"/>ri semper colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
